CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'interface != PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_MII'
#618: FILE: drivers/net/ethernet/stmicro/stmmac/stmmac_main.c:283:
+	if ((interface != PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_MII) &&
+	    (interface != PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_GMII) &&
+	    !phy_interface_mode_is_rgmii(interface))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

